SlateportCity_SternsShipyard_1F_Text_Generator::
    .string "The yard's generator. It runs the\n"
    .string "cranes, the lights and the pumps\l"
    .string "that keep the dry dock dry.\p"
    .string "A card taped to the housing reads:\n"
    .string "DON'T TOUCH. THIS MEANS YOU,\l"
    .string "CAPTAIN.$"

SlateportCity_SternsShipyard_1F_Text_GeneratorPikachu::
    .string "The PIKACHU puts both paws on the\n"
    .string "housing before anyone can stop it.\p"
    .string "The lights along the dock come up\n"
    .string "a shade brighter, and stay there.\p"
    .string "A yard hand stares, then writes\n"
    .string "something down on his clipboard.$"

SlateportCity_SternsShipyard_1F_Text_H0::
    .string "If this bracket goes here, and the\n"
    .string "long one goes there…\p"
    .string "…then what in the world is this\n"
    .string "third one for?\p"
    .string "Don't tell the CAPTAIN I asked.$"

SlateportCity_SternsShipyard_1F_Text_H1::
    .string "Season, weather, where the moon is\n"
    .string "sitting that night.\p"
    .string "Change any one of them and the sea\n"
    .string "outside this door is a different\l"
    .string "sea.\p"
    .string "You learn to ask it how it's doing\n"
    .string "before you go out on it.$"

SlateportCity_SternsShipyard_1F_Text_H2::
    .string "I'm sick before we've left the\n"
    .string "quay, so I keep the yard instead.\p"
    .string "Somebody has to be standing here\n"
    .string "when the ship comes back.$"
